---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About - Swastik Industries" current="about">
<main><section class="about-banner"><img src="/assets/about-banner.jpg" alt="Building a strong foundation for a stronger future. Incorporated in 2005, head office in New Delhi." width="1600" height="733" fetchpriority="high"></section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="split about-split"><div class="about-img"><img src="/assets/site/chain.jpg" alt="Steel chain links" loading="lazy"></div>
<div class="tx"><h2 class="about-h">Building strong foundation for a stronger future</h2>
<p>A lot of our society is made of steel and concrete; it is a material central to sustainability in modern society. Swastik Industries was incorporated in India in 2005, with its head office at New Delhi. Our primary objective is to provide high quality industrial products, which help in the development of the economy.</p>
<p>With expertise in a full spectrum of industrial products, Swastik collaborates closely with its clients to provide hands-on support and equipping them with the best products. Having supplied cable trays for development of prime industries, from metros to telecom towers, we believe that it is important to invest in high quality infrastructure today so that we are prepared for the coming tomorrow.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="trust-sec"><div class="wrap"><h2 class="trust-h">Trust the best</h2>
<div class="trust-grid"><div class="trust-tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" width="84" height="84" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M40 5 68 15v23c0 18-12 30-28 36C24 68 12 56 12 38V15z" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="40" cy="38" r="14" fill="none" stroke="var(--tile-bg)" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M33 38l5 5 10-11" fill="none" stroke="var(--tile-bg)" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><p>Superior quality at competitive prices.</p></div><div class="trust-tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" width="84" height="84" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="62.5,35.4 70.7,36.0 70.7,44.0 62.5,44.6 59.2,52.7 64.6,58.9 58.9,64.6 52.7,59.2 44.6,62.5 44.0,70.7 36.0,70.7 35.4,62.5 27.3,59.2 21.1,64.6 15.4,58.9 20.8,52.7 17.5,44.6 9.3,44.0 9.3,36.0 17.5,35.4 20.8,27.3 15.4,21.1 21.1,15.4 27.3,20.8 35.4,17.5 36.0,9.3 44.0,9.3 44.6,17.5 52.7,20.8 58.9,15.4 64.6,21.1 59.2,27.3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="11" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"/></svg><p>Engineered to perfect dimensions, shape, thickness and length with punch hole optimization, which makes it convenient for on-site use.</p></div><div class="trust-tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" width="84" height="84" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="62" height="62" rx="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"/><text x="40" y="45" text-anchor="middle" font-size="25" font-weight="700" fill="currentColor" font-family="Roboto,Arial,sans-serif">Zn</text><text x="40" y="56" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9" font-weight="700" fill="currentColor" font-family="Roboto,Arial,sans-serif">Zinc</text><text x="40" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-size="6.5" font-weight="700" fill="currentColor" font-family="Roboto,Arial,sans-serif">65.39</text><text x="15" y="21" font-size="6.5" font-weight="700" fill="currentColor" font-family="Roboto,Arial,sans-serif">30</text></svg><p>Corrosion Free: Galvanised using high grade zinc.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="why-sec"><div class="wrap"><h2 class="trust-h">Why us</h2><div class="why-layout"><div class="why-col why-left"><div class="why-item"><div class="why-tx"><h3>Quality</h3><p>We are committed to excellence in everything we do and strive to deliver value to our clients beyond what is expected. If something is worth doing, it is worth doing well.</p></div><span class="why-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.7 3.3a1 1 0 0 0-1.4 0L9.6 13l1.4 1.4 9.7-9.7a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.4zM8.2 14.6c-1.9 0-3.2 1.4-3.2 3.1 0 1-.6 1.8-1.5 2.3 3.4.7 7.7-.2 7.7-3.4a2.1 2.1 0 0 0-3-2z"/></svg></span></div><div class="why-item"><div class="why-tx"><h3>Relationship</h3><p>As a relationship driven organization, we aim to be transparent with our clients at all levels. We build long term relationships based on trust and reliability. We strive to earn our client's trust through our actions and commitment to success.</p></div><span class="why-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2 4.5 13.5H11L10 22l9-12h-6.5z"/></svg></span></div></div><div class="why-logo"><div class="why-emblem"><img src="/assets/logo-white.png" alt="Swastik Industries, established 2005" width="204" height="84" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="why-col why-right"><div class="why-item"><span class="why-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h13a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v14a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1zm2 3v2h9V7zm0 4v2h9v-2zm0 4v2h6v-2z"/></svg></span><div class="why-tx"><h3>Customer centricity</h3><p>Client is at the center of everything we do: our services and business processes are tuned to their needs. Every action we take is aimed at delivering value for our clients and championing their interests at every moment.</p></div></div><div class="why-item"><span class="why-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19.4 13a7.7 7.7 0 0 0 0-2l2.1-1.6-2-3.4-2.5 1a7.5 7.5 0 0 0-1.7-1L15 3.3h-4l-.4 2.7a7.5 7.5 0 0 0-1.7 1l-2.5-1-2 3.4L6.6 11a7.7 7.7 0 0 0 0 2l-2.1 1.6 2 3.4 2.5-1a7.5 7.5 0 0 0 1.7 1l.4 2.7h4l.4-2.7a7.5 7.5 0 0 0 1.7-1l2.5 1 2-3.4zM13 15.5a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 0-7 3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7z" transform="translate(-1 0)"/></svg></span><div class="why-tx"><h3>Strong foundation</h3><p>With over 20 years of experience and having delivered material to the reputed companies across India, we have a strong foundation in this industry.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="alt clients-sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><h2 class="h-xl">OUR CLIENTS</h2></div><img class="clients-img" src="/assets/clients/our-clients.png" alt="Our clients: Delhi Metro, Delhi Indira Gandhi International Airport, ETA Engineering, Lanco, Jakson, Amplus Solar, Larsen &amp; Toubro, SAEL, Blue Star, Avaada and Ornate Solar" width="1700" height="350" loading="lazy"></div></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Send your drawing or bill of quantities</h2><a class="btn" href="/contact">Request a quote</a></div></section></main>
</Layout>
